{"product_id":"english-time-level-1-10-total-development-program-skills","title":"English Time Level 1–10 – Total Development Program (Skills)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"562\"\u003eEmbark on a captivating journey to English proficiency with the English Time series. Designed for young learners, this comprehensive 10-level program introduces children to the English language through engaging stories, interactive activities, and colorful illustrations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"846\"\u003eEach level builds upon the previous one, ensuring a structured progression from basic vocabulary and sentence structures to more complex language concepts. The series emphasizes listening, speaking, reading, and writing skills, providing a holistic approach to language acquisition.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1010\"\u003eIdeal for children aged 3 to 8, the English Time series offers a fun and systematic way to master English, laying a strong foundation for future academic success.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1076\"\u003eTitle: English Time Level 1–10\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1134\"\u003ePublisher: Educational Technologies Limited (ETL)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1185\"\u003eSeries: Total Development Program – Skills\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1217\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover Books\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1243\"\u003eLanguage: English\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809414799513,"sku":"3RA398762","price":200.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/IMG_20251021_185057.jpg?v=1761058575","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/english-time-level-1-10-total-development-program-skills","provider":"Dub